<refnamediv>
  <refname><type>SilikoInput</type></refname>
  <refpurpose>Type representing a source of input characters</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Input.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">typedef /* ... */ SilikoInput;</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <type>SilikoInput</type> type represents a user-provided
source characters to be used by a lexical analyzr to convert to
tokens.</para>
